<!doctype html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Chasely — Get invoices paid without the awkward follow-up</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Chasely drafts your invoice payment reminders for you — friendly, then firm, then final — so freelancers stop losing afternoons to chasing clients." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Chasely — Get invoices paid without the awkward follow-up" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Chasely drafts your invoice payment reminders for you — friendly, then firm, then final — so freelancers stop losing afternoons to chasing clients." />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
  <style>
    .hero{padding:70px 20px 40px;text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;}
    .hero h1{font-size:2.1rem;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 14px;}
    .hero p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 26px;}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}
    .strip{max-width:820px;margin:56px auto;padding:0 20px;}
    .strip h2{font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center;margin-bottom:28px;}
    .stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;}
    .stages .st{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;}
    .stages .st .day{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em;}
    .stages .st h3{margin:6px 0 6px;font-size:1rem;}
    .stages .st p{margin:0;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
    .pricing{display:flex;gap:18px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px;}
    .plan{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:26px;width:230px;text-align:center;}
    .plan .price{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin:8px 0 2px;}
    .plan .per{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.82rem;}
    .plan ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:18px 0;text-align:left;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ink-soft);}
    .plan li{padding:4px 0;}
    footer.site{text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.85rem;}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="brand">Chasely</div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="/blog">Guides</a>
      <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/signup">Start free</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Get invoices paid without writing another awkward follow-up email.</h1>
    <p>Add an unpaid invoice. Chasely tells you exactly what to send and when — friendly at day 3, firm at day 10, final notice at day 21 — with your payment link built in.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn" href="/signup">Start free — 3 invoices, no card</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="#pricing">See pricing</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="strip">
    <h2>The three-message sequence that gets responses</h2>
    <div class="stages">
      <div class="st"><div class="day">Day 3</div><h3>Friendly nudge</h3><p>Assumes it slipped through. Short, warm, payment link included.</p></div>
      <div class="st"><div class="day">Day 10</div><h3>Firm follow-up</h3><p>Asks directly for a date, gives room to flag a real problem.</p></div>
      <div class="st"><div class="day">Day 21</div><h3>Final notice</h3><p>States terms plainly — late fees, paused work — and asks for same-day reply.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="strip" id="pricing">
    <h2>Pricing</h2>
    <div class="pricing">
      <div class="plan">
        <div>Free</div>
        <div class="price">$0</div>
        <div class="per">up to 3 invoices</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Full reminder sequence</li>
          <li>Unlimited reminders per invoice</li>
          <li>One-click payment links</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="/signup" style="display:block;">Start free</a>
      </div>
      <div class="plan" style="border-color:var(--accent);">
        <div>Freelancer</div>
        <div class="price">$19</div>
        <div class="per">per month</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Unlimited invoices</li>
          <li>Full reminder sequence</li>
          <li>Payment tracking dashboard</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn" href="/signup" style="display:block;">Start free</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer class="site">
    Chasely — built for freelancers and small agencies who'd rather bill than chase.
    <div style="margin-top:8px;">
      <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a> · <a href="mailto:mohamad.alalami@gmail.com">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
